<title>PAKISTAN: Karachi stock market capitalisation falls.</title>
<headline>Karachi stock market capitalisation falls.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Karachi Stock Exchange said on Monday that market capitalisation of listed firms had fallen to 465.745 billion rupees in May from 467.652 billion in April.</p>
<p>						May	  April  Listed</p>
<p>capital (bln rupees)	   206.457    204.458  Market</p>
<p>capitalisation (bln rupees)  465.745    467.652  Turnover of</p>
<p>shares (million)	  775.944    931.362  KSE 100 index</p>
<p>(points)		1,507.96   1,538.82  KSE all share index</p>
<p>(points)	  938.75     943.73</p>
<p>($1 = 40.49 rupees)</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
